This repository includes third-party source code in one file only: records/tinyiot/tinyiot-lab.patch is a patch of
tinyIoT (https://github.com/seslabSJU/tinyIoT, commit c140495). Its context lines and the lines it removes are
tinyIoT's code, under tinyIoT's licence (BSD-3-Clause, reproduced below); the lines it adds are the author's. The
tinyIoT run records (records/tinyiot/) hold tinyIoT's log output, not its source.
It uses these projects as installed dependencies:
- ACME oneM2M CSE (https://github.com/ankraft/ACME-oneM2M-CSE), BSD-3-Clause, installed with pip (acmecse==2026.5.3).
- FastAPI, Starlette, uvicorn, pydantic, httpx, jsonschema, cryptography, pytest: each under its own licence,
  installed with pip (requirements/lab.txt).
The MEC service implementations in this repository are the author's own implementations of ETSI GS MEC APIs. The ETSI
MEC test suites (ETSI Forge, BSD-3-Clause) are not included; the records of runs against them are.
oneM2M and ETSI MEC specifications are referenced, not reproduced.

